#. module: bf_editorial
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_editorial.view_editorial_entry_form
msgid "<strong>Publishing is held back.</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>La publication est retenue.</strong>"

#. module: bf_editorial
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_editorial.view_editorial_entry_form
msgid ""
"<strong>The waiver no longer covers anything.</strong> The text has changed "
"since it was signed. Sign it again on the current findings, or revoke it."
msgstr ""
"<strong>La dérogation ne couvre plus rien.</strong>\n"
"                        Le texte a bougé depuis sa signature. À signer de\n"
"                        nouveau sur les constats actuels, ou à lever."

#. module: bf_editorial
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_editorial.view_editorial_entry_form
msgid ""
"<strong>This entry is under a waiver.</strong> The QA still sees what it "
"sees; it is the refusal to publish that gave way, on the signed reasons and "
"on those only."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Cette entrée est sous dérogation.</strong>\n"
"                        La QA voit toujours ce qu'elle voit; c'est le refus de\n"
"                        publier qui a cédé, sur les motifs signés et sur\n"
"                        ceux-là seulement."

#. module: bf_editorial
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:bf_editorial.action_editorial_calendar
msgid ""
"A calendar is a publishing flow with its rules: the target cadence, the "
"required languages, the pillars and their targets. Several flows can "
"coexist."
msgstr ""
"Un calendrier est un flux de publication avec ses règles : la\n"
"               cadence visée, les langues exigées, les piliers et leurs cibles.\n"
"               Plusieurs flux peuvent cohabiter."

#. module: bf_editorial
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:bf_editorial.action_editorial_pillar
msgid ""
"A pillar is the blog's native tag category: the public site already knows "
"how to display and filter it."
msgstr ""
"Le pilier est la catégorie d'étiquette native du blogue : le\n"
"               site public sait déjà l'afficher et la filtrer."

